Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Scientific Basis", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9608934568635464`*^9, 
  3.960893468633259*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"16415c77-f7ad-664c-9793-\
4a291f46bdce"],

Cell["\<\
Droplet dynamics during cloud seeding are described by the K\[ODoubleDot]hler \
equation, which presents cloud seeding through two opposing forces: \
evaporation, exemplified by the curvature effect, and condensation, \
exemplified by Raoult\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Law. \
