Cell["\<\
It is impossible to run the calculations with a detached Bromide anion, thus \
it must be removed. The bromide anion is removed by using MoleculeModify to \
delete the atom after finding its index.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960915843516741*^9, 3.960915930820408*^9}, {
