Cell["\<\
Indication that it has been removed is seen in how the number of atoms \
decreases from 63 to 62, but to verify whether Bromide has been deleted, the \
net charge must be checked. The net charge should be 1+ as a negative charge \
has been deleted. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960915939300523*^9, 3.960915997420608*^9}, {
   3.960972793229604*^9, 3.960972793664113*^9}, {3.960972848822967*^9, 
