Cell["\<\
The potential energy (eV) as a function of distance (nm) is plotted and saved \
as the quantity array data. The domains of the bond lengths tested are 0.2nm \
to 10nm. This range was specifically chosen as it extends below the Van der \
Waals radius of both the nitrogen and oxygen particles and extends \
significantly past that when it is has reached its asymptote.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9610148243710327`*^9, 3.961014843773087*^9}, {
  3.961015076121689*^9, 3.961015147149851*^9}, {3.961023047366836*^9, 
  3.961023050018194*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eadcea09-6d38-8644-9e76-\
9bf34e66ec3e"],

