Cell["\<\
The ComplexEnergy function calculates the binding energy of the molecular \
complex. The lower the complex energy, the better the configuration. Since \
the isolated molecules do not change, the complex energy is sufficient to \
determine which configuration will be the most optimized.\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9611477486573668`*^9, 
  3.961147839440926*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7c40ab8a-74c5-a44f-b92d-\
b722b75ce1e1"],

